// Public Suffix List - TRIMMED SNAPSHOT for Geode (GAP-0877)
// Source: https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
// Snapshot date: 2026-06-11 (curated subset; NOT the full list)
// License of the upstream list: Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0
//
// This is a deliberately trimmed snapshot covering the major generic TLDs,
// common country-code TLDs, the most widely used multi-label registry
// suffixes, a small set of wildcard/exception rules, and a handful of
// well-known private-domain suffixes (github.io etc.). Domains whose TLD is
// not listed here fall back to the PSL default "*" rule (suffix = last
// label, registrable domain = last two labels).
//
// Format: one rule per line; "// " comments; "*" wildcard label;
// "!" exception rule. See https://publicsuffix.org/list/ for the algorithm.

